&lt;li&gt;Design and execute sales strategies tailored to the region&#39;s distinct markets, accounting for differences in market maturity, regulatory environment, language, and buying behaviour across Southeast Asian countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by identifying high-potential customer segments and use cases within the region&#39;s startup and scale-up ecosystem, including fintech, e-commerce, super-apps, gaming, SaaS, and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish foundational go-to-market practices as a first mover in ASEAN, creating playbooks, templates, and frameworks that scale with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps by gathering customer feedback and conveying market needs specific to Southeast Asian enterprises, including multilingual and localisation requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners in product, marketing, solutions, and partnerships—including regional cloud and channel partners—to differentiate our offerings and sustain a competitive edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a market expert on ASEAN&#39;s digital-native landscape, providing strategic insight to global leadership on regional trends, competitive dynamics, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
